  "total_duration": 37.25,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "text": "How did someone measure the Earth 2,200 years ago with a stick?",
      "start": 0.4,
      "end": 4.0,
      "dur": 3.6,
      "audio": "line_00_placeholder.wav",
      "engine": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "text": "At noon in Syene, the sun stood straight overhead. No shadow.",
      "start": 4.35,
      "end": 7.65,
      "dur": 3.3,
      "audio": "line_01_placeholder.wav",
      "engine": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "text": "The same day in Alexandria, a vertical stick cast a short shadow.",
      "start": 8.0,
      "end": 11.5,
      "dur": 3.5,
      "audio": "line_02_placeholder.wav",
      "engine": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "text": "The shadow gave the sun's angle from vertical: about 7.2 degrees.",
      "start": 11.85,
      "end": 15.45,
      "dur": 3.6,
      "audio": "line_03_placeholder.wav",
      "engine": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "text": "Sun rays are parallel, so that angle also sits at Earth's center.",
      "start": 15.8,
      "end": 19.5,
      "dur": 3.7,
      "audio": "line_04_placeholder.wav",
      "engine": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "text": "7.2 degrees is one fiftieth of a full circle.",
      "start": 19.85,
      "end": 22.75,
      "dur": 2.9,
      "audio": "line_05_placeholder.wav",
      "engine": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "text": "The two cities were about 800 kilometers apart.",
      "start": 23.1,
      "end": 25.9,
      "dur": 2.8,
      "audio": "line_06_placeholder.wav",
      "engine": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "text": "Fifty of those arcs make the whole circumference.",
      "start": 26.25,
      "end": 29.15,
      "dur": 2.9,
      "audio": "line_07_placeholder.wav",
      "engine": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "text": "That gives 40,000 kilometers. The true value is 40,075.",
      "start": 29.5,
      "end": 32.9,
      "dur": 3.4,
      "audio": "line_08_placeholder.wav",
      "engine": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "text": "One shadow, one angle, and geometry did the rest.",
      "start": 33.25,
      "end": 36.35,
      "dur": 3.1,
      "audio": "line_09_placeholder.wav",
      "engine": "placeholder"
    }
  ]
}